<title>USA: V-ONE products to be distributed in Chile.</title>
<headline>V-ONE products to be distributed in Chile.</headline>
<dateline>GERMANTOWN, Md. 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>V-ONE Corp said Tuesday it entered into an agreement for Magenta Computacion SA to distribute V-ONE products in Chile.</p>
<p>The company said Magenta plans to market its client-server security product called SmartGate bundled with other security technologies from companies such as Cisco Systems Inc and Seattle Software Labs.</p>
<p>V-ONE said Magenta is part of the worldwide Cisco distribution channel and its customers include several large banks and telecommunications companies in Chile.</p>
